    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "CLASSIFIED\n\nTemporal Environmental Adjustment Medication (T.E.A.M) PROGRAM
    STATUS\n\nDURATION SUMMARY:\n\nIt has been concluded that the effects of the
    *REDACTED* Sulfide will last for about 30 seconds per 200 MG of dosage. It was
    also found through the experiments that electrical devices do not provide a accurate
    estimate of the duration of each subject in the temporal realm. Due to the electrical
    interference caused, the R&D department had to resort to using analog clocks
    to measure the duration.  It is recommened that further experiments should be
    carried out using mechanical devices for time keeping purposes. \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
