    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'INCIDENT REPORT #24876


    CLASSIFED ELEMENTS


    SUMMARY:


    It
    has been concluded that subject #3456 - Mark J. Jones stabbed research recruit
    Clem Mills in the dormitory showers and cut off bits of their flesh. The likely
    cause of the stabbing was a psychotic episode brought on by unauthorized usage
    of the Temporal Environmental Adjustment Medication with pescription cough medication.
    All related evidence will be photographed and tagged and the crime scene documented
    with the documents being turned over to local law enforcement. All confidential
    information will remain classified to outside law enforcement.





'
