  m_Text: "Dr. Jane,\n\n \tWe've recieved authorization to distribute the ATEM medication
    to the patients in the Far Wing. Each Patient should receive one pill of medication
    a day and be monitored for side effects. Under no circumstances should the patients
    have access to the medication containers as ingesting more than 3 pills will
    activate the temporal effects and allow them to jump through time. Please remain
    on note for further instructions. \n\n- Dr Goodard"
